{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-tracing","title":"分布式追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/logging-and-observability/distributed-tracing","wordCount":650,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式追踪\">分布式追踪</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>分布式追踪（Distributed Tracing）是在微服务架构中追踪一个请求从进入系统到最终响应的完整调用路径的技术。当一个用户请求可能经过 10+ 个服务、数十次 RPC 调用时，单个服务的日志无法还原全貌。分布式追踪通过 Trace ID 将所有相关操作串联为一棵调用树，让跨服务问题的排查从&quot;大海捞针&quot;变为&quot;按图索骥&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"trace-span-和-context\">Trace、Span 和 Context</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph TRACE[&quot;Trace: 完整请求生命周期&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;Span A: API Gateway 120ms&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Span B: Order Service 80ms&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; C[&quot;Span C: Auth Service 15ms&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; D[&quot;Span D: Payment Service 45ms&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; E[&quot;Span E: Inventory Service 20ms&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; F[&quot;Span F: Bank API 30ms&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph TRACE[\"Trace: 完整请求生命周期\"]\n        A[\"Span A: API Gateway 120ms\"] --&gt; B[\"Span B: Order Service 80ms\"]\n        A --&gt; C[\"Span C: Auth Service 15ms\"]\n        B --&gt; D[\"Span D: Payment Service 45ms\"]\n        B --&gt; E[\"Span E: Inventory Service 20ms\"]\n        D --&gt; F[\"Span F: Bank API 30ms\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Trace</td>\n<td>一个请求的完整调用链</td>\n<td>一棵调用树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span</td>\n<td>一次操作的时间区间</td>\n<td>调用树的一个节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Context</td>\n<td>跨服务传播的标识信息</td>\n<td>请求的&quot;身份证&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parent Span</td>\n<td>发起调用的 Span</td>\n<td>父节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child Span</td>\n<td>被调用产生的 Span</td>\n<td>子节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"w3c-trace-context-标准\">W3C Trace Context 标准</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"# HTTP 请求头中的追踪上下文传播&#10;traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01&#10;#             ^  ^                                ^                ^&#10;#          version  trace-id (128-bit)        parent-id (64-bit)  flags&#10;&#10;tracestate: vendor1=value1,vendor2=value2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># HTTP 请求头中的追踪上下文传播</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#             ^  ^                                ^                ^</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#          version  trace-id (128-bit)        parent-id (64-bit)  flags</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tracestate: vendor1=value1,vendor2=value2</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"opentelemetry-实现\">OpenTelemetry 实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go: OpenTelemetry 手动创建 Span&#10;package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10;    &quot;context&quot;&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel&quot;&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute&quot;&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;var tracer = otel.Tracer(&quot;order-service&quot;)&#10;&#10;func ProcessOrder(ctx context.Context, orderID string) error {&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;ProcessOrder&quot;,&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;order.id&quot;, orderID),&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;order.type&quot;, &quot;standard&quot;),&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;    defer span.End()&#10;&#10;    // 子操作自动成为子 Span&#10;    if err := validateOrder(ctx, orderID); err != nil {&#10;        span.RecordError(err)&#10;        span.SetStatus(codes.Error, err.Error())&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if err := chargePayment(ctx, orderID); err != nil {&#10;        span.RecordError(err)&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    span.AddEvent(&quot;order_completed&quot;, trace.WithAttributes(&#10;        attribute.Int(&quot;items_count&quot;, 5),&#10;    ))&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go: OpenTelemetry 手动创建 Span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><spa